WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.725
Let’s walk through Close the specialist loop.

00:00:02.725 --> 00:00:05.550
On this slide, confirm no assigned item is left

00:00:05.550 --> 00:00:08.488
in an ambiguous state before leaving the console.

00:00:08.488 --> 00:00:11.575
In practice, pending means work remains.

00:00:11.575 --> 00:00:15.787
Finalized or acknowledged means the named specialist boundary was completed

00:00:15.787 --> 00:00:17.438
and remains auditable.

00:00:17.438 --> 00:00:20.062
Before you continue, verify these points:

00:00:20.062 --> 00:00:21.750
Check the active session.

00:00:21.750 --> 00:00:23.825
Verify the recorded status.

00:00:23.825 --> 00:00:26.738
Leave incomplete work pending rather than guessing.

00:00:27.285 --> 00:00:31.172
Use the highlighted Session reference area as your visual reference

00:00:31.172 --> 00:00:32.910
while you complete this check.
